{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"engagement.schema.json","title":"Engagement（委任設定，白箱開始前 G0a 驗章）","description":"在 W0 之前驗證：程式碼所有權聲明、資料等級（未填即 C）、每個資料等級允許的模型、run_owner、預算與關卡逾時。任何送往 LLM 或在 Z2 執行程式碼的步驟都要先通過。簽署人只能引用金鑰登錄中的人（D11）。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"engagement_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/engagement_id"},
"version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
"purpose":{"type":"string"},
"issued_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime","description":"簽署時間；用於判斷簽署時金鑰是否有效"},
"key_registry_ref":{"type":"string","description":"金鑰登錄位置；必須等於 toolkit.yaml key_registry.location"},
"run_owner":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id","description":"自動觸發（schedule／merge）時的紀錄發起者；必須是登錄中的人，不能是自動化帳號（docs/02 §1.5）"},
"budget_approver":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"GB 的核准者；null＝由 run_owner 核准"},
"code_ownership":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"repositories":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"owner":{"type":"string"}},"required":["url","owner"]},"minItems":1},"attested_by":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_ref"},"attestation":{"const":true}},"required":["repositories","attested_by","attestation"]},
"data_class":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/data_class"},
"allowed_models":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"P":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1},"C":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["P","C"],"description":"每個資料等級允許的模型（models.yaml 的 key）"},
"lane_a_model":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Lane A 單一家族 diff 審查用的模型；必須在該資料等級的允許清單中；null＝Lane A 不送 LLM"},
"owasp_llm_version":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["2025","2026"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"B2 使用的 OWASP LLM Top 10 版本；null＝沿用 toolkit.yaml owasp_llm_default（預設 2026，docs/04 §2.3）"},
"telemetry_disabled":{"const":true},
"retention_days":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"本委任的有效內容保存天數（唯一生效值）。只能比 toolkit.yaml retention 的組織上限短或相等（C 級：c_days_after_run_end；P 級：p_days），超過 → E-RETENTION；ROE data_handling.retention_days 只能再縮短"},
"validity":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"not_before":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},"not_after":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"}},"required":["not_before","not_after"]},
"budgets":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"run_total":{"$ref":"#/$defs/caps"},"W":{"$ref":"#/$defs/caps"},"B":{"$ref":"#/$defs/caps"}},"required":["run_total","W","B"],"description":"docs/03 §11；費用上限必填（工具包沒有預設金額）"},
"gate_timeouts_hours":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"claim_run":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"G1":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"G2":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"G3":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"G4":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"G5":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"GB":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"description":"只能比 toolkit.yaml 短（validator 檢查）"},
"signatories":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_ref"},"minItems":1,"description":"至少含 app_owner（G0a）；可另加 management"},
"gate_approvers":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"白箱關卡（ROE 生效前）的核准者登錄：G0a／G1／G2 的核准者必須列在這裡且有對應的金鑰登錄角色（E-GATE-APPROVER-ENG）。G0b／G3／G4／G5 的核准者來自 ROE（E-GATE-ROE-APPROVER）","properties":{"G0a":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true},"G1":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true},"G2":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true}},"required":["G0a","G1","G2"]},
"providers":{"type":"array","description":"LLM 供應商的資料處理聲明（H-E14）：代理的模型能收到 C 級資料時，模型必須自架（api_base 在 Z4），或其家族 zdr＝confirmed 且 dpa_signed＝true（E-ENG-PROVIDER）","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"family":{"type":"string"},"zdr":{"enum":["confirmed","not_available","unknown"]},"zdr_evidence_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"dpa_signed":{"type":"boolean"},"retention_days":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":0},{"type":"null"}]},"region":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["family","zdr","zdr_evidence_ref","dpa_signed","retention_days","region"]}},
"assurance_profile":{"enum":["lite","team","full"],"description":"lite：只允許 S0／S1（E-PROFILE-SAFETY；MANUAL 測試案例除外），role_consolidation.acknowledged 時同一人可兼任多個 ROE／關卡角色；team：每個 ROE 簽署角色由不同人擔任（E-ROE-SOD）；full：team＋G5 需兩位不同的 security_reviewer（E-G5-TWO-PERSON），relay adaptive 只在 full"},
"role_consolidation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"acknowledged":{"type":"boolean"},"person_id":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},{"type":"null"}]},"statement":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["acknowledged","person_id","statement"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"只在 lite 有效：acknowledged true 時 person_id 這個人可以兼任多個 ROE／關卡角色；報告首頁標示「角色兼任」"},
"signatures":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/signature"},"minItems":1}},
"required":["engagement_id","version","purpose","issued_at","key_registry_ref","run_owner","budget_approver","code_ownership","data_class","allowed_models","lane_a_model","owasp_llm_version","telemetry_disabled","retention_days","validity","budgets","gate_timeouts_hours","signatories","gate_approvers","providers","assurance_profile","role_consolidation","signatures"],
"$defs":{"caps":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_input_tokens":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"max_output_tokens":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"max_cost_usd":{"type":"number","minimum":0},"max_compute_minutes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"required":["max_input_tokens","max_output_tokens","max_cost_usd","max_compute_minutes"]}}}
